OL,3,GNEWSABin strike deal 'very close', says
OL,4,Acouncil leader
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe leader of Birmingham City Council
OL,7,Fhas said it is waiting for "final
OL,8,Fadvice" on a deal which could end the
OL,9,Fcity's long-running bin strike.
OL,11,FLiberal Democrat Roger Harmer, who is
OL,12,Fleading the minority administration
OL,13,Fwhich took over after the May
OL,14,Felections, said in a statement on
OL,15,FTuesday the leadership had "worked
OL,16,Fconstructively with Unite over recent
OL,17,Fmonths" and agreement was "very close".
OL,19,F"The council is awaiting final advice
OL,20,Ffrom its external auditors prior to
OL,21,Ftaking a final decision," he said.
OL,23,APub: 06-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
