OL,3,GNEWSABin strike deal 'very close', says
OL,4,Acouncil leader
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe authority has been in a stand-off
OL,7,Fwith members of the union Unite over
OL,8,Fpay and job roles for more than 18
OL,9,Fmonths. Unite has been contacted for
OL,10,Fcomment.
